ICOSale.setApprovedAsset

when called by the owner with a non-zero asset and flipping from false → true or vice versa
    it sets approval to correct indicator
        expect isApprovedAsset[_asset] == indicator
    it emits PayAssetApprovalSet
        expect event with correct parameters

when _asset is the zero address
    it reverts and does not change state
        expect revert with Errors.ZeroAddress

when the indicator is already set to the requested value
    it reverts and does not change state
        expect revert with Errors.IndicatorAlreadySet

when called by a non-owner
    it reverts and does not change state
        expect revert with Ownable.OwnableUnauthorizedAccount including caller
